  <Title>k__BackingField: Reputation
  <Chapters>k__BackingField:
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Basics
    <Description>k__BackingField: Each town tracks how much it likes you based on
      your actions. A towns reputation influences their trade prices and may unlock
      other advantages.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3f6c70e54ab649749a3a8ebbc3f2bdbf, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: How to influence Reputation
    <Description>k__BackingField: A towns reputation is influenced by many factors.
      Most importantly, how favorably you choose to trade with them and if you are
      able to satisfy thei requests.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: df1e2a1738bfdc444a7cf410297a84b8, type: 3}
